## 2. Security Analysis

### 2.1 Strengths ✅

| Feature | Implementation | Location |
|---------|----------------|----------|
| **Policy Decision Engine** | Centralized access control | [policyDecision.ts](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\shared\policyDecision.ts) |
| **Session Security** | Revocation tracking, TTL enforcement | [auth.ts](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\middleware\auth.ts) |
| **Bot Detection** | PoW challenges, EWMA scoring, device fingerprinting | [botGuard.ts](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\security\botGuard.ts) |
| **Impersonation Protection** | Read-only mode, TTL (15 min) | `auth.ts:70-146` |
| **Audit Trail** | Hash-chained tamper-evident logging | [identityAudit.ts](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\services\identityAudit.ts) |
| **Anti-Grift System** | 12 modules for fraud detection | [grift/](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\grift) |
| **Jurisdiction Controls** | IP/Geo-based access restrictions | [jurisdictionSessionGuard.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/middleware/jurisdictionSessionGuard.ts) |

