## 3. Code Quality Analysis

### 3.1 Critical Issues 🔴

#### 3.1.1 TypeScript Checking Disabled

**15 files** have `@ts-nocheck` directive, bypassing type safety:

| File | Lines | Concern |
|------|-------|---------|
| [routes.ts](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\routes.ts) | 4,908 | Core routing logic |
| [storage.ts](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\storage.ts) | 1,611 | Database operations |
| [index.ts](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\index.ts) | ~400 | Server entry point |
| [vite.ts](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\vite.ts) | 188 | Build configuration |
| [quoteFeed.ts](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\feeds\quoteFeed.ts) | ~100 | Quote processing |

**Impact**: Type errors may go undetected, increasing runtime error risk.

**Recommendation**: Incrementally enable type checking by fixing errors in these files.

#### 3.1.2 Monolithic Route File

[routes.ts](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\routes.ts) is **4,908 lines** - a significant maintainability concern.

**Current structure**: One [registerRoutes()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes.ts#166-4908) function containing all route definitions.

**Recommendation**: Already partially modularized (20 router files in `server/routes/`), continue extracting routes from the monolithic file.

### 3.2 Moderate Issues 🟡

#### 3.2.1 Console Logging in Production

**21 files** contain `console.log` statements in server code. Should use structured logging.

#### 3.2.2 Large Page Components

| Component | Size | Concern |
|-----------|------|---------|
| [AdminDashboard.tsx](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\client\src\pages\AdminDashboard.tsx) | 243 KB | Extremely large, should split |
| [ProfileSettings.tsx](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\client\src\pages\ProfileSettings.tsx) | 71 KB | Consider extraction |
| [TradeScreen.tsx](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\client\src\pages\TradeScreen.tsx) | 63 KB | Complex trading UI |

#### 3.2.3 E2E Test Coverage

Only **1 spec file** ([runbook.spec.ts](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\e2e\runbook.spec.ts)) with **10 KB** of tests.

**Recommendation**: Expand test coverage for critical user flows (trading, verification, admin).

