## 7. Recommendations Summary

### 7.1 High Priority 🔴

| Issue | Action | Effort |
|-------|--------|--------|
| TypeScript disabled in 15 files | Enable strict mode incrementally | High |
| Monolithic routes.ts (4908 lines) | Extract to modular routers | Medium |
| AdminDashboard.tsx (243KB) | Split into sub-components | Medium |

### 7.2 Medium Priority 🟡

| Issue | Action | Effort |
|-------|--------|--------|
| Limited E2E tests | Add critical path coverage | Medium |
| Console logging | Implement structured logging (Winston/Pino) | Low |
| Large page components | Extract reusable modules | Low |

### 7.3 Low Priority 🟢

| Issue | Action | Effort |
|-------|--------|--------|
| MOBILE iOS support | Verify and document iOS build | Low |
| Unit tests | Add for critical business logic | Medium |

